{
  "notes": "Offline, fixture-based eval for isbn_fusion.py / main._build_isbn_intelligence(). Each case supplies already-parsed provider metadata (the same shape main.py's provider parsers produce) directly, so it exercises the FUSION step in isolation from network calls, retrieval timing/budget and the ISBN checksum validator - those are covered by test_isbn_field_level_retrieval.py and main.py's ISBN validation tests instead. A source with no entry (or null) represents that provider not answering, whether because it was never called, timed out, errored, or genuinely found nothing - fusion cannot tell those apart and is not supposed to. `synthetic: true` marks a case built by hand for this eval rather than taken from a real lookup.",
